bàcce waa Galàdd bàccukaayi weñ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay yebal sawara seen waa kër Buur Asayel,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mu xoyom taaxi Buur Ben Addàd.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay dàjji bunti dëkkub Damaas,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"dagg waa xuru Awen","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"boole ca boroom yetu nguur fa Bet Eden","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":".","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Waa Siri dugg ngàllo, dellu Kir","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":".»","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Aji Sax jee ko wax.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Aji Sax ji nee:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Ñetti bàkkaar, su ma yeboo ne ñeent,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"laay sikke waa Gasa","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te duma fomm seeni duma.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ñoo jàpp ba noppi gàddaayloo mbooloom lëmm,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"jalax leen ca Edomeen ña.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay yebal sawara ca tatay Gasa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mu xoyom ay taaxam.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay dagg waa Asdodd","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ak boroom yetu nguur fa Askalon,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"fél Ekkron,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ndesu Filisteen ña sànku.»","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Boroom bi Aji Sax jee ko wax.","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"Aji Sax ji nee:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Ñetti bàkkaar, su ma yeboo ne ñeent,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"laay sikke waa Tir","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te duma fomm seeni duma.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Am na mboolooy lëmm yu ñu gàddaayloo,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te ñoom waa Tir jaay leen Edomeen ña,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te sédduñu leen ci kóllëreg mbokk gi.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Damay yebal sawara ca tatay Tir,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mu xoyom ay tataam.»","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Aji Sax ji nee:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Ñetti bàkkaar, su ma yeboo ne ñeent,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"laay sikke waa Edom","poem":1},{"noteId":9},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te duma fomm seeni duma.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ñoo toppe seen bokki bànni Israayil saamar,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"jalax yërmande,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mer mer mu dul meddi","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ak xadar ju dul giif mukk.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay yebal sawara fa Teman,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mu xoyomaale tatay Boccara","poem":1},{"noteId":10},{"text":".»","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"Aji Sax ji nee:","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"«Ñetti bàkkaar, su ma yeboo ne ñeent,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"laay sikke Amoneen","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"ñi,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"te duma fomm seeni duma.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ñoo butti ay jigéeni biir ca Galàdd,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ba ñuy xare ngir yokk seen suuf.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Maay jafal ca kaw tatay Raba","poem":1},{"noteId":12},{"text":",","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mu xoyom ay taaxam,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yuux ya jib bésub xare,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ci biir callweer bésub ngëlén.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Seen buur lañuy jàpp, mu gàddaay,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"mooki kàngamam.»","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Aji Sax jee ko wax.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"1.1 Tekowa sorewul Yerusalem. Ba bànni Israayil xàjjalikoo nekk ñaari réew gannaaw ba Buur Suleymaan nelawee, Tirca njëkkoon naa nekk péeyub réewum Israayil, Samari tegu ca; Yerusalem di péeyub réewum Yuda.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"1.1 Osiyas mooy Asaryaa itam.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"1.2 Siyoŋ mooy tund wa kër Yàlla ga nekk ca Yerusalem. Daan nañu ko tudde it dëkku Yerusalem.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":2}},{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"1.3 Damaas mooy péeyub réewum Siri.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":3}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"1.5 xuru Awen mooy tekki xuru Ñaawtéef.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"1.5 Bet Eden mooy kërug Àjjana, muy tekki fii Kërug Xawaare.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"1.5 Kir la Arameen ñi cosaanoo. Gannaaw gi lañu sanci réewu Siri. Seetal ci 9.7.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":5}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"1.6 Gasa, benn la ci juróomi dëkki Filisti yu mag; yeneen yi di Asdodd ak Askalon ak Ekkron ak Gaat. Seetal ci 6.2.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"1.9 Tir dafa mel ni Sidon. Ay dëkk yu mag lañu woon ca réewum Fenisi.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":9}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"1.11 waa Edom ñaa nga bàyyikoo fa bëj-saalumu Yuda jàpp penku. Ñu ngi soqikoo ci Esawu, magu Yanqóoba, kon bokki Israayil lañu woon, waaye dañoo faroon ak nooni Israayil.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":11}},{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"1.12 Teman ak Boccara, ay goxi Edom yu mag la woon. Boccara moo doon péeyu Edom.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":12}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"1.13 Amoneen ñu ngi soqikoo ci Lóot. Réew mi ñuy wax Yordani tey, ci lañu dëkkoon.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":13}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"1.14 Raba, péeyu Amon la woon.","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/wol_mbs/AMO/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/wol_mbs/AMO/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/wol_mbs/JOL/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}